{"seq":9,"slug":"cell-biology","title":"细胞生物学","stage":"DONE","category":"biology-life-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"细胞生物学\">细胞生物学</h1><p>把一只手放在显微镜下，你看到的不是一块连续的肉，而是数以亿计各自为政又彼此协作的小室。细胞是生命的最小自持单位——它能取能、复制信息、应答环境、在恰当的时刻自我了结。本 hub 沿着「以细胞为生命基本单位」这条主线，把分散在生物化学、遗传学、发育学里的知识重新编织成一张以结构对应功能的网络。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 分四章，呈递进关系。</p>\n<p>第一章「细胞基础」回答「细胞是什么、由什么围起来、里面装着什么」。从细胞学说与原核/真核两大谱系出发，进到把内外分隔开来的生物膜与跨膜运输，再到膜系统在胞内折叠出的一整套细胞器与内膜系统。这一章奠定后续所有讨论的物理舞台。</p>\n<p>第二章「能量与代谢」回答「细胞靠什么活着」。线粒体如何把食物里的化学能转成 ATP，叶绿体如何把光转成化学能，二者都依赖同一条膜上的化学渗透原理；最后把酶动力学、能量感应与离子/pH/氧化还原稳态整合成细胞的代谢全局观。能量是结构得以维持、信息得以处理的前提。</p>\n<p>第三章「信息与调控」回答「细胞如何感知与决策」。细胞信号转导让外界刺激变成胞内动作，细胞骨架既是形状与运动的支架也是信号与运输的轨道，细胞周期与分裂则把「是否、何时复制自己」这个最重大的决定交给一套精密的检查点机器。信息流驾驭着能量流。</p>\n<p>第四章「命运与前沿」回答「细胞如何走向终点与未来研究怎么看它」。凋亡与自噬是细胞主动管理生死的两套程序，干细胞与分化解释一个受精卵如何长成两百多种细胞，单细胞技术与细胞图谱则是 2026 年读懂这一切的新眼睛——人类细胞图谱已profile超过一亿个细胞，正逼近首版全身草图。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层相扣：有了结构才能装下代谢，有了能量才能驱动信息，有了信息才能决定命运，而前沿技术让我们第一次能在单个细胞的分辨率上把前三者一并看清。建议按章序阅读；各文档之间已用相对链接互相指引，遇到某概念在别处主讲时会直接带你过去。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-fundamentals","title":"细胞基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-theory-and-types","title":"细胞学说与细胞类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/cell-theory-and-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"membranes-and-transport","title":"生物膜与膜运输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/membranes-and-transport"},{"seq":3,"slug":"organelles-endomembrane-system","title":"细胞器与内膜系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/organelles-endomembrane-system"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"energy-metabolism","title":"能量与代谢","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mitochondria-respiration","title":"线粒体与细胞呼吸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/mitochondria-respiration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chloroplast-photosynthesis","title":"叶绿体与光合作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/chloroplast-photosynthesis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-metabolism-homeostasis","title":"细胞代谢与稳态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/energy-metabolism/cell-metabolism-homeostasis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-regulation","title":"信息与调控","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/information-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-signaling","title":"细胞信号转导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/information-regulation/cell-signaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cytoskeleton-and-motility","title":"细胞骨架与运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/information-regulation/cytoskeleton-and-motility"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-cycle-and-division","title":"细胞周期与分裂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/information-regulation/cell-cycle-and-division"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"fate-frontiers","title":"命运与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/fate-frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"apoptosis-and-autophagy","title":"细胞凋亡与自噬","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/fate-frontiers/apoptosis-and-autophagy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stem-cells-differentiation","title":"干细胞与细胞分化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/fate-frontiers/stem-cells-differentiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"single-cell-technologies-atlas","title":"单细胞技术与细胞图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/fate-frontiers/single-cell-technologies-atlas"}]}]}